#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:7
msgid ""
"Routers can be viewed, created, and managed from the Routers tab of the "
"Infrastructure > Networks page. |morpheus| supports the creation of the "
"following router types depending on networks that are currently configured:"
msgstr ""
"Enrutadores se puede ver, creado, y administrado desde el Enrutadores "
"pestaña del Infraestructura > Redes página. |morpheus| soporta el creation "
"del siguiente router tipos dependiendo de networks ese son actualmente "
"configurado:"

